    <ol>
    <li>1 <b>USB/AUX</b> indicators: When the External Device is connected, indicator is lights up.</li>
    <li>2 <b>MP3/WMA</b> indicators: When the Audio Stream is detected, indicator is lights up.</li>
    <li>3 <b>Stereo [ST]</b> indicator for FM stereo station: When a stereo Broadcast is received, indicator is lights up.</li>
    <li><p>4</p>
      <ul id="ul_06281047">
            <li>
              <b>Playback mode</b> indicators for USB mode</li>
            <li>
              <fig>
                <image href="../media/image246.png"/>
              </fig> : Folder mode</li>
            <li>
              <fig>
                <image href="../media/image247.png"/>
              </fig> : Intro playback</li>
            <li>
              <fig>
                <image href="../media/image248.png"/>
              </fig> : Repeat playback</li>
            <li>
              <fig>
                <image href="../media/image249.png"/>
              </fig> : Random playback</li>
          </ul></li>
    <li><p>5</p>
      <ul id="ul_06281048">
            <li>LOUD/EQ indicators for sound effect</li>
            <li>
              <b>LOUD</b>: Loudness mode on</li>
            <li>
              <b>EQ</b>: EQ mode on</li>
          </ul></li>
    <li>6 <b>Multi-function</b> display area for showing the information</li>
    </ol></conbody>
</concept>
